[00:13.77]1. God’s Kingdom rules from above.
[00:27.55]All praise his Son, the beloved.
[00:33.15]Christ reigns in Zion, the chief cornerstone.
[00:44.83]Let us all lift up our voice.
[00:48.65]Sing to our God, and rejoice.
[00:52.48]Christ, Lord and Savior,
[00:56.31]has been placed upon His throne.
[01:01.06](Chorus)
[01:09.60]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[01:16.36]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[01:23.12]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[01:26.73]Eternal life and happiness.
[01:30.73]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[01:36.23]For his love and faithfulness.
[01:57.60]2. Christ now in power is here,
[02:01.34]And Armageddon is near.
[02:05.08]Satan’s old system will soon pass away.
[02:19.96]Now is the season to preach.
[02:25.00]Many there are yet to reach;
[02:30.76]Time for the meek
[02:34.92]to take their stand for Him today.
[02:38.82](Chorus)
[02:42.72]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[02:48.36]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[02:54.20]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[03:00.00]Eternal life and happiness.
[03:05.76]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[03:11.61]For his love and faithfulness.
[03:20.44]3. God’s reigning Ruler we prize.
[03:29.28]Wondrous he is in our eyes.
[03:38.11]He comes in God’s name; we bow to our King.
[03:51.07]Enter the grand temple gate;
[03:55.20]God’s favor now supplicate.
[03:59.32]Soon dawns that day
[04:03.45]when he rules over ev’rything.
[04:07.58](Chorus)
[04:11.71]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[04:19.77]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[04:23.27]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[04:29.07]Eternal life and happiness.
[04:35.45]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[04:41.49]For his love and faithfulness.